// MECHANISM (established): the churn is spuriously-rebound TransientParked
// sites re-igniting the settled recursion. The parked-wake check
// (callsite.rs ~1588: event.init || arg_fired || ext_refs triggered) is a
// hair trigger during the init cycle (event.init true throughout), and the
// rebind's prime_args backfills the site's arg VACANT-in-event from the
// tag-blind rt.cached (the descent published clean args there; tainted
// productions deliberately never reach the cross-cycle store) — so the
// redispatch sees clean-FIRED args and redescends (CS trace shows
