//
// OPEN QUESTION (why parked, not fixed): pre-A1 runs the SAME wake check,
// the SAME prime_args backfill, and the SAME prime-then-replay — its 127
// spurious rebinds each dispatched once and SETTLED. The era delta that
// makes fresh-compile settle where pool-pop redescends is still
// unestablished — two candidate channels were tested and DISPROVEN:
