// The divergence is inside the pooled instance's dispatch itself.
// Diagnostic setup that survives: pre-A1 worktree at /home/eric/tmp/prea1-wt
// (built at /home/eric/fp-target/prea1/release/graphix-fuzz), fp+debuginfo
// post-A1 binary at /home/eric/fp-target/release/graphix-fuzz, churn perf
